```mermaid
flowchart TD
    User([User / Client])
    R53[Route 53]
    ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    IGW[Internet Gateway]
    
    subgraph EKS Data Plane
        Ingress[ALB Ingress Controller]
        Service[Kubernetes Service]
        Pod1[App Pod 1]
        Pod2[App Pod 2]
    end
    
    User -->|DNS Query| R53
    R53 -->|IP Address| User
    User -->|HTTPS| IGW
    IGW --> ALB
    
    ALB -->|Target Group Routing| Pod1
    ALB -->|Target Group Routing| Pod2
    
    Pod1 -->|Data Read/Write| RDS[(Amazon RDS)]
    Pod2 -->|Assume IRSA Role| DynamoDB[(DynamoDB)]
```
